  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Feel Food is a family restaurant in central Toulon, at 10 rue du Bon Pasteur, on a square in the heart of town. Its website describes modern, seasonal Mediterranean cooking with fresh local produce. The tourist office adds that everything is homemade, with several vegetarian and vegan options built around produce from the Var. The menu changes every month.</p>

      <h2>Dogs</h2>
      <p>The tourist office listing (Provence Méditerranée, on the regional portal, updated 30/12/2024) says: "Animals accepted on the terrace only". The restaurant's own website does not mention dogs. Your dog is therefore welcome on the terrace, not in the dining room. Size limits and a water bowl are not specified.</p>

      <h2>Hours and booking</h2>
      <p>The tourist office gives Tuesday to Saturday, 12pm to 3pm and 7pm to 10:30pm, all year. You can book online on the restaurant's website or by phone on 06 09 99 08 23. TheFork rates it 9.6/10 from 193 reviews.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: ask for a terrace table when you book, since that is the only area where your dog is allowed.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The restaurant is in central Toulon, within walking distance of the old town streets. The tourist office lists parking nearby.</p>
